    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u05.l03",
      "sha256": "e57f0472cee9adbe69d9cf23569c854080d863053d95e076d8c48efd58524048"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u05.l04",
      "sha256": "796119f2c9b26b9f12daa6d332c01390d5a9242cfcf580de908d8e38d53e1e89"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u05.l05",
      "sha256": "bf766567de4cb0118e91c8a08579704c00f6011f99b8fd57428e987d10b02e7f"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u05.l06",
      "sha256": "4b2929c5b495eb1429ca194ee5e91e0bc02e25d075137d3e6a237b2297f8d1dd"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u05.l07",
      "sha256": "d2134f312d45c3a2e0d7b4b540218ecd7402b90343ea2469df10f9b4d16029a3"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u05.l08",
      "sha256": "d5b4593bf8eb1536efa66d26f1cec429669cfae1a09d4f35c866fcf28608d3b6"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u05.l09",
      "sha256": "3603ec71f73fc2f634e4e93dafda7feb5e861f4cab5b86fff656d608f43dac28"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u05.l10",
      "sha256": "8ce8082078514862eada0a9239fc5d4491c4f4f2e483fc79fdc650b793e08105"
    },
    {
      "id": "bipa4.u05.l11",
      "sha256": "b3cd89bdb724f20dc9602231153765319a89607470926561294be80b5bc610ed"
    }
  ],
  "audio": [
    {
      "key": "004fdbec0a506d58c8888b1a926b4d8b9dcf6c97e4a44c018b7c0755c304c6fb",
      "text": "Mohamed, besok salat Id di Lapangan Karebosi. Imamnya ulama terkenal.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "09e284d88cafe1813f6662d5a02ac7e962ef0a502d5b0da000b3422e914b6093",
      "text": "Habis gelap terbitlah terang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 29,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0a284b9d4587ec5766cf531a4e473b8b9288c74cb3a4c2747958bc47752fde25",
      "text": "Kartini menulis banyak surat kepada sahabatnya di Belanda. Dalam surat-suratnya, ia menceritakan mimpinya tentang pendidikan bagi kaum perempuan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 145,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0c19b9062ea785fdf320f392279e63bd1fde49af530563ca2b9c46a5d3be7e5a",
      "text": "Keren! Di sini orang bilang guru itu pahlawan tanpa tanda jasa, kan?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "0decd006864ac6cf1637f41f780a615c89723a8611e346fcf7f992ebfdedbec8",
      "text": "Setiap 21 April, kita memperingati Hari Kartini.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "109811cef808c7d1b8b90a292d06c8192afd4c90656a23cbc99c829fef942033",
      "text": "Mohamed, kamu dengar pengumumannya? Hadiah panjat pinang ada sepeda!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "118e155204d7374c153bad9d2d7f6de6e5c6ba7269b47ef8df227613c04f18fc",
      "text": "kesatuan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "12503511b4d3c21c9fb7150268619e23fe3c50bc5e75bbac70da41d7e79a81c2",
      "text": "Kami menghormati bendera Merah Putih dan jasa para pahlawan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 60,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "132ddb41430040260b02d05d683f274060b078f6a5af96f7b9661eb7203db6fd",
      "text": "Tanggal: 17 Agustus. Pukul: 07.00 WITA. Tempat: lapangan di jantung Kota Palopo.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 80,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "14779278638b5c7a15c07b846bcfabcec74205138fd999b72d1cebc3543ea435",
      "text": "Lomba balap karung untuk anak-anak dimulai pukul sembilan di depan masjid.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 74,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "160f494b28bacceb2cea1041465f7502f68000601a78068f6fdedba359e82d4a",
      "text": "pramuka",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "163bca34e1ac5061dac99cdbf687d548dbcd8bc59f09e49aa195eee6ba0c616f",
      "text": "Peserta upacara diharapkan memakai baju putih dan datang tepat waktu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1a0eb2473386ea12a9fdd45c0433bd8d8d27e3697f4db57592c2a86803804fb7",
      "text": "rangkaian",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1b380d1c8faef51c1e71f2079616e15ae8f3ab023e794eca1debad8c42a169aa",
      "text": "Warga menyalakan lampion di depan rumah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 40,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1c6127b84619824d9df945fb0562235d87dcaadd7c68e684d0e3b9a371d21d19",
      "text": "Kartini adalah pejuang emansipasi dari Jepara.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "1eb50b18af5c1b15a03d570005f352f06ad699f3693ae862d4463cf186593d97",
      "text": "Di surat itu, peserta harus pakai baju putih.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "228f7d79386261998f5a50ac660cf2ff7644f21f27b83416d545b31770fa735d",
      "text": "kaum perempuan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 14,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "245e988462ad9058f4e31f6b3d522485c79bada02e7f9b3730e731d1b0479243",
      "text": "Oh ya? Apa yang paling menarik?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 31,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "26130119b3c4d48c65cef21eaf16315e161d4d7a6ed39c52cec55bcf92b44a98",
      "text": "Guru adalah pahlawan tanpa tanda jasa.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 38,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "26fe391fed2864efb88b6523c0909e0ee0bbf4093f6443fa572cbc3dd1da47d6",
      "text": "merdeka",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2821fd1583375c71dbe3def161d8d50155688bdd3295754753b696a3f550b343",
      "text": "Menjelang tujuh belasan, kami memasang bendera dan menyiapkan kostum.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2c4821865ddd98689ecff701ff1ec8b88130616cb49aa365bf5aac9a7a8a9ae7",
      "text": "Bagi Kartini, pendidikan adalah terang setelah gelap. Itulah arti emansipasi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 77,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2d97324e483d1e50b6e8106396a0182edc28ae8bbddc55fea2cfef5fd997f1af",
      "text": "Aku harus gimana waktu Merah Putih naik?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 40,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2e3b05da604f46e2c0393afc43a983d2034cc6f76b138fde2c5f868b78c6535b",
      "text": "Banyak: makan-makan dulu, lalu kegiatan amal untuk warga yang miskin.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2ed5e840fb2d17e0ce442c2266435c29d788730b52f9332dfeb81fc07ce78294",
      "text": "Mohamed, di Mesir ada hari besar nasional kayak 17 Agustus nggak?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2f4837070fbd09063408b7747ddc825f16263c87c12503f99d607081debd26d4",
      "text": "ritual",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "2ff15e3fed2fd5dd3de3f99823ae988cf2c18a18e92536fc2c2a8b8d558131b5",
      "text": "Jangan telat, ya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 17,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3701dae9ea6f4cf4f338707e765f94dd7e7f382513cebf7d0bb7eecf507dbade",
      "text": "menyatukan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "391da1d4af32b50dbfd5896441d5b2796c48af384dbd2c6146ad4ad968963552",
      "text": "Siapa Kartini?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 14,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "39b7edbc340a3b03a1a903a4e48c1e1c5ad07130116e16c6af28623ae55dac15",
      "text": "Peserta panjat pinang harap berkumpul di lapangan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3a5f2cf37a8f93608501cbfb8f2c873a0a238902603dddacbd1d4d6a6c13981c",
      "text": "upacara bendera",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 15,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3a619fd2ebda9c382e32ecd0cc148d7c01c5083c9d3c8b19b7bab8b434aad0e6",
      "text": "tanda jasa",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "3fcc81294fa12b8433d5f9cd53c77d9d1f492873a688ebe7978078bb72f0248e",
      "text": "menyambut",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "400a89d322e324a71447fb1e5b2e2e60e8a5e16e49ad94d1aa760a3eaa6205b3",
      "text": "Anak adalah buah hati orang tua.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 32,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4049ed9d0a659e4d2d725d8470abdfac8ccce3ff736317a91ded94b1c10263e7",
      "text": "Iya. Suasana tujuh belasan emang selalu meriah.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "40eb21182da5d3c59d855183cc1bb84da91995414d9fcd1c3a4bb60e072d01f6",
      "text": "tahunan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "40f3c3cd53e8e4cd672814434e427ef9824ea828a7d6d493b55355e1ca6fdbf2",
      "text": "Siap! Aku bakal berdiri dengan tenang waktu Merah Putih naik.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 61,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4147c8d661a26afbf5bce4caab36c5e1a1c1494b831196b80d69ebf5e94f03f6",
      "text": "pejuang",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "427b8ef567791eb7151740decfaa9e03ee0f09c79ccf933037316940e3c6bf58",
      "text": "Betul. Dalam rangka Hari Kemerdekaan, semua warga boleh datang.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "45a35c13a214ce967d9b4f59acac5156d8f3e56724993bd9d15a502c9191f9d3",
      "text": "tangan kanan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "46eba3f05df958c571fadf80fa0e6c70b750a8efc35b76fed32ce845b0b57aa9",
      "text": "Imam memimpin salat Id di Lapangan Karebosi.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "473d6b964ad4a08bc68e270c85dc88d137e1bf70f883b1150cbbffb7e001e578",
      "text": "perlombaan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "481701789c8675709eb59515a79310bb1afaeb9c188e765fbfea1065caf6be37",
      "text": "Seru! Aku perlu kostum nggak?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 29,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "49d8a0c3057502158d71a6a040d21639e320843346d544ea9ceaef075ed8922a",
      "text": "Mau! Kita memperingati Hari Kemerdekaan, kan?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4ab8094fbef1372b8ae072bfcdb8a8d75102969b6d40b910a59d275789edacff",
      "text": "jasa",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4b53d1eff75d798c926ae5652ee00a4dc183686a5ebd81057dce407549ad8d8e",
      "text": "Orang Mesir dan orang Indonesia sama-sama menghormati jasa para pahlawan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 73,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "4b77f989fe9a78633a04924768af117fd8845751006a1a47f863cd9949c6947b",
      "text": "Merah Putih",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 11,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "504e2c41036fa1966b98233310ba15acc2013e1fc1ec0cad1a2d7bb46fd0de24",
      "text": "Suasana lomba tujuh belasan selalu ___.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "515307617f609c7038f14ec477fb09d884b2c876126456aacc8d6bb39989e0ea",
      "text": "Lomba balap karung dimulai pukul sembilan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 42,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5297c95d473c475af23f0432bb3bae3400173c95432143c49f778fc0ae6616bc",
      "text": "purnama",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "532ed5192f9aeb932dc9216fa13ca9640dfd75d7f583a2204017f4ba0fd9fcc7",
      "text": "Festival tahunan ini punya tarian dan ritual yang indah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "534bdbf24752e869f658c8514f4da547a3f97a8aad368fecd4e6725a69757f19",
      "text": "berpartisipasi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 14,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "54375c5952881c92fe5372c44579418e122fc76160c842df703ec03ce66356e0",
      "text": "Dan murid-muridnya adalah buah hatinya!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5796fa91aa404eaeb1a42302f1f02c8cc0c8d028ca4fdb7aa982a36182a56cfd",
      "text": "Pejuang emansipasi. Dia ingin kaum perempuan bisa sekolah. Surat-suratnya jadi buku, judulnya Habis Gelap Terbitlah Terang.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 123,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "58582e13077b43d1c6306c22e7ef2321136d0d20bc7f76ac790f5d8b6c883dad",
      "text": "Hari ini 21 April. Kita memperingati Hari Kartini.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5c0d2cfdbd72e04cd8be2174dbff9e31225386f6eac4391037e886d499494922",
      "text": "Warga menyemangati peserta panjat pinang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 41,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5d71242fb0354a87099c9d344970187f432686c8237f2fe371bb42166c90f989",
      "text": "Peserta upacara diharapkan datang tepat waktu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5dc59c70ba876361f2f66467fa6126c726d5436831c826e62512aab075814e7b",
      "text": "Guru adalah pahlawan tanpa tanda jasa. Kita harus menghormati mereka.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 69,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5df264e55c33a012e6587e68c0f8c1c3c3220d5c3f75cde81f3e5e279b5269ed",
      "text": "jantung kota",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "5eef7647320cd4e4844016c6ab1dddbad69745ee477e29967355494965a36b21",
      "text": "Iya, pas malam bulan purnama. Ada tarian barongsai dan ritual di kelenteng.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 75,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "629ea0a11d0b1c5bdc595171630d8a38b23b444d8b3b79cc1bdcdbc0e06663f0",
      "text": "peserta",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "62cb530a293ca93831ddb0bcbdaee4279cf795959b2a121c1ff7067307d2a22b",
      "text": "Cap Go Meh dirayakan pada malam bulan purnama.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "645f68718ad63708e0a7a22db60deeb9ae9d089f5a879cbfb93b40b7630cfc1f",
      "text": "buah hati",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "67c30e458a56cc37db10e30eb82f4b68eb37546af1c0c3698aea15888e2eb85a",
      "text": "Kita harus ___ jasa para pahlawan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 34,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "69e6c76b4368792294aace154cd690648cea67b69feac88818e76d8354f5847f",
      "text": "kostum",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6a5b4706822c97b34c1ead5da47d3372992102b171a253a66119d65db3f183a3",
      "text": "Insya Allah aku datang. Habis itu ada kegiatan apa?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 51,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6b14cd849c58ff21e80320a64a69fe775fdce30d866eee0d66fc40cf48aa2618",
      "text": "dalam rangka",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "6ed4133223bb864dc64b57c3eb378ec8a5d4d1f0b17d123c609209542c7a918d",
      "text": "Setelah Kartini meninggal, surat-surat itu dijadikan sebuah buku: Habis Gelap Terbitlah Terang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 95,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7075c0cf8b00cb9cf84e377b8c8ee7ad704578668107b79f879f0794f6267d75",
      "text": "Dalam rangka memperingati Hari Kemerdekaan, kami mengundang Bapak/Ibu menghadiri upacara bendera.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 97,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "70887f8f4eeb3ac2b68a72b5b57cbe4c81718ae316fd7d2b7066c7266084aebc",
      "text": "Ayo, Bapak-Ibu, kita menyemangati para peserta. Semoga lomba tahun ini meriah!",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 78,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "70e7b96e6fb2dbc78f3298bd0ddb9fa6c1e1fdad2e9967fddc93cf32c0502138",
      "text": "Hadiahnya sepeda, kipas angin, dan tas sekolah!",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7144f13e057229390652789a3c9a312d0ce6c6447e1b240c1c0b4343edcbb789",
      "text": "menyemangati",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "715f8e158b70e46611e650f2551295b3625805758b31413cc1b71505d8d56cb6",
      "text": "lomba",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "71b42b993329fc3ffe0d1506f2cc88b89e8922dddeeeb2412df8930037f87d7f",
      "text": "Suasana lomba sangat meriah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 28,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7783ee4f1fcf057e09d6173766e99b3c3e901ad3f1ff2a86df03a2089f963a0c",
      "text": "amal",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7891bac89b90849a8905780fe6d6dece613bf99b430ccf8f42e078c662780a1c",
      "text": "Mohamed, ayo ikut lomba balap karung!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 37,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "796332b984de4e893655599264ad4d28d0172d125f81e80172892d55f6a3f3c9",
      "text": "Orang-orang juga menyalakan lampion?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 36,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "79ea67e7241bcc16ea786023742d91a6c2b95f10c420c32407138f46e4aa5866",
      "text": "Bener. Surat-surat itu terus jadi buku.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7bdc6f79c74522c992c3142b866df7b2d9e3162ecf52cfe9ffcbe8f0b15f58dc",
      "text": "Pak Irwan selalu membantu kepala sekolah. Dia adalah ___ kepala sekolah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 72,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7c014f621e67de2455c0629a8d8a38649722570449e99b82a112e3f277189b62",
      "text": "Lebaran menyatukan keluarga tercinta dalam kedamaian.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7df30d43e699a1fad16438769c88fd9bbcbbe8fcacb76e035d2f36b5265de2c3",
      "text": "Banyak orang berpartisipasi dalam kegiatan amal.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7e6196df2598a896349bd4e34e8f30899ba8942b4bb57d2f6bd0a99b4b62416e",
      "text": "Tanggal hari libur ___ oleh pemerintah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7eede6d07b22528c7b4dcbce7ca05be6f442601951eafeaab86fd47643e60d7c",
      "text": "Ada lomba kayak panjat pinang juga?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 35,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "7f8bf03308238c34165f6537c7b951e47309a51454013929474ea37bf23240e4",
      "text": "Perlombaan diadakan di lapangan kampung.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 40,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "80e36fd512ffcc03bdee10ba108eb051fcce96dde3a4726f172410573911b05f",
      "text": "Kok hari ini semua murid perempuan pakai kebaya?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8275a4a6d0bf93003d7b56e4d1f4df48ac7ce6905843c0cdd793963c9632a274",
      "text": "Suasananya meriah sekali! Hadiah panjat pinang ada di atas tiang.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 65,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "82c9e51148432c5bf0606cd4ac7924699d3d68d4e3e71a0dbf8207b30e4b3201",
      "text": "panjat pinang",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 13,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "84227f23f87087bfc07d19c177069409a2cc549be958f133fc403d5305d009d3",
      "text": "Boleh. Suasananya bakal meriah!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 31,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "862a4a7b11de5542390bb6cbbfff78a66a026fe4fe2bb3309ae67449c7b2850f",
      "text": "memperingati",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8d12c3d442a5ced13fcc5c44c47949ccac0d055423184f0ecc13d85ab325d254",
      "text": "Mau! Itu festival tahunan, ya?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 30,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "8ddca26ea21272aaee3ec4f3ad94b68274da5b8b17de7352a9148f98bf490e1e",
      "text": "Nggak ada. Biasanya ada acara resmi dan lagu nasional di TV. Tapi Lebaran di Mesir meriah banget!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 97,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "91f748278012db490ce80894906a48b25cf1daedd3b77bfcf12049d5e7a36754",
      "text": "Kita menghormati jasa para pahlawan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 36,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "92ec115c5df0ec10deca5ba59f7ebeeae7f9d1d100fb74c8dcaff45067d736f7",
      "text": "Dia menulis banyak surat kepada sahabatnya di Belanda.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "946dee39bd7ee1a3cdad587a2ab45c5846000ca07e9cbf797589bfefef85d276",
      "text": "Kalau gitu, aku menyemangati dari bawah aja.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9554a452f0aac63f595aa38486dccb8236ec13d541386f920bc068985ac70cf3",
      "text": "Peserta panjat pinang harap berkumpul di lapangan. Hadiahnya sepeda, kipas angin, dan tas sekolah!",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 98,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "95975da5e1d1a7516356170fded414cce1c71b2a190128ef10b17fd055fc3c76",
      "text": "Pakai baju merah putih aja. Kita sama-sama menyambut hari merdeka!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 66,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "975789b66966ab4bf60daa27f77c61b31603d191fb60fac6d35744c66003ee30",
      "text": "Iya, ha-ha. Para peserta harus bekerja sama.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 44,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "976d98e181b4cfa2adffdfa8923dde3a340d63cb79c22f3a76f228cb119eed39",
      "text": "festival",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "97e20910cb1ca64dd1930421b5a0761f54f429be9655a3d757166aa9ecf9e242",
      "text": "tarian",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9d740a31d7f51b4ff910106b72f8ad3b672630277ff08494ba8d3d4b39543360",
      "text": "Dengar! Tapi panjat pinang itu susah banget, kan?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9ecb2365a97b15f74c96773cf7744b739bc3cc5c70dc29cd7918466a39ecfe7b",
      "text": "Aku mau berpartisipasi. Di Mesir juga ada kegiatan kayak gitu.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 62,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "9f3a298572762fa70e6912c2b90bf69ca8635d113f2197a021837cb0bc12aa84",
      "text": "Mohamed, minggu depan ada perlombaan tujuh belasan di kampung kami.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 67,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a05ed0d9e8c8871eb94432dc5ce0ac71bdd7a99fcd9626e825333dd128b7378f",
      "text": "Perhatian, perhatian! Lomba balap karung untuk anak-anak dimulai pukul sembilan di depan masjid.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 96,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a0b413156d7857f8124f808a79a1abe356b3379491133c05fe26a93e284b2b0f",
      "text": "Tenri, aku baru baca tulisan tentang Kartini.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a7dd235f99f772327256a1d8a9417f343986a30d017a0847cc6bde038ccbadfc",
      "text": "Lebaran menyatukan keluarga yang tinggal jauh.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a7def9b753f69072f64a54a54b8d755602818993af3c9c7ffd49dadf6ef3126f",
      "text": "tanpa",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 5,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a83cc20ce96cfaba5b2403fc08332eea3bceaf4363b0f628c9085b850d62a918",
      "text": "Setelah salat, saya merasakan ___.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 34,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a865c58314af3379d4148b759d82e09d98e96857a3071282ce9d2955b636caf7",
      "text": "Metafora yang indah! Gelap artinya nggak tahu apa-apa, dan terang artinya belajar.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 82,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "a9146a3d7c8f106c559d2d306a7976c58542c6b3a963c939211cdb63dbaab3d8",
      "text": "diadakan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "aaa7ac4f99a2971a8a84a835277f8a77cf4f61add092bd2cff7442b98db23a7a",
      "text": "Iya. Dan jangan kesiangan, upacara nggak nunggu!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ab56a0c70536499a2b4a5b5b355a4cc178292dc8a84af897c5f32cb467850fae",
      "text": "Besok Hari Guru Nasional. Di sekolah kami di jantung kota, kami akan memberi bunga kepada Bu Ratna.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 99,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "acbc83238dc36c63158e052b240498daf6844df6ccd90ac5f2b9fe6937a99ecb",
      "text": "menyalakan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "afc80cfc426a3383a5d52a560239b7da2162a3e30e152b91dcc79490d941adad",
      "text": "Tenri, aku dapat surat dari kantor kota buat menghadiri upacara. Mulainya jam tujuh, ya?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 88,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "afcd3765754012c6264ae1959eb53761ae2244ac9c964eb15bf2980e65a828f9",
      "text": "Aku? Aku belum pernah! Aku menyemangati aja, ya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b45b30a8c2c91741aeb1df6f752fb4e7570353a5d25b050ec3c5fc155cfc9ee0",
      "text": "Di lapangan dekat masjid. Anak-anak pramuka juga ikut.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b4720142b5cb971525b7e667fd7bb715419b6b3a36aa26a56ed7ffd6f1ff725d",
      "text": "Ada. Setiap 23 Juli kami memperingati Hari Revolusi.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 52,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b628deb7f14349b340d63e0030cae6c7e4a99c6cb590b6b88829d912d9b0782d",
      "text": "Raden Ajeng Kartini lahir di Jepara pada 21 April 1879. Pada zaman itu, banyak anak perempuan tidak boleh sekolah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 114,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b735ef6bb676285d4146ab960705ebad9d0a744ac21d689d0628e5d973b611a3",
      "text": "Setiap 17 Agustus, kita memperingati Hari Kemerdekaan.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "b9b9cf54b8642db5a27a156ba9a14f7f0af6c5ddb386578ced9cdd3c29e446dc",
      "text": "Lihat, itu panjat pinang! Hadiahnya banyak banget.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 50,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bc39ebe920cd3e8b47eeb0c643e9dfe1000966af59c60cce3f8fa68190300df0",
      "text": "Menjelang 17 Agustus, bendera ada di depan setiap rumah.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bd05827498efdd5dd0d314e102d02078f4a208df0540a8f1d1c810c20edea468",
      "text": "tercinta",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 8,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "bda8151b297a78d519955c641beb3b3f005cd9ac17587adc9106c21ff4867ece",
      "text": "Festival ini diadakan setiap tahun di bulan Februari.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 53,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c2c6afb219f3912ffa2b37295148aedb1b5df34af6ed99457241b02304e3a39c",
      "text": "Semua penari berpakaian merah di festival itu.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c2f7d8287af17d901b57df75d339f50319f3fbb5a46e65382c1c74baa893ca40",
      "text": "kebaya",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c61c9942542805daa2375dfc6c9409859f64b23ddeeb2738028a74cf9c80634a",
      "text": "balap karung",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 12,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c6f144223b595103cac945ff3cb29e57dc945241e66ab54c801e33031729aa6e",
      "text": "Mohamed, malam ini Cap Go Meh di Jalan Sulawesi. Mau lihat?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "c9f3869247253c419f07fa3e6c1a980e5fe44cc4d5c513829cfcddbc141a14cd",
      "text": "Iya, dan banyak yang berpakaian merah. Mereka percaya merah bawa untung.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 72,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cd4b039f47a8b12a7aeb5872a9b31a9f237102c617169bc1fcb26a7c58b6b072",
      "text": "Rangkaian acara Lebaran dimulai dengan salat Id.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 48,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "cda062d7b094b866372dc639453c0fcb75cbd968f4e7eeb2645c7dc95e9c5a8a",
      "text": "meriah",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 6,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ce014554191cdcd20b6ff60339fa0ffe7d180f73828eabd6513b9859d44b438a",
      "text": "menjelang",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d074989616f008da49ab93bbed63f12d2f8b09f24b2d592c93211e402ca2b2e9",
      "text": "Keren! Lebaran emang menyatukan kita semua.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 43,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d2a501f78dbbd72be46afbecef1ce3af0bef7cfd81768f8cd5157c9b08d3436a",
      "text": "Anak-anak mengikuti lomba balap karung.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d36ff197a151ebf35183973cfa989a520b36f067a40b02dc8dcc412016e79225",
      "text": "Tujuh puluh tahun lalu kakek saya berteriak, \"Merdeka!\"",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 55,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d3ddd35b0dca69e14c86e6e8916401c872c8ed13c373e0f4fff3b349921a1015",
      "text": "Dia minum kopi tanpa gula.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 26,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d435eeec909aea5632ad58de46f819a48c455a5ccfe92b29a3d56bfb5ec88c76",
      "text": "Mohamed, besok pagi kamu mau menghadiri upacara bendera di lapangan?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 68,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d4bfad7861c1a3bd253cf34f7ccaa41fb01879248f714820b40a333ddaba37fb",
      "text": "Judulnya metafora yang indah. Setelah gelap, datang terang.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 59,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d52dbbae79314b9d40e444cc4a7e97b8c0a01418aa32f92fcd2ac3b96e8b90f0",
      "text": "Bahasa Indonesia menjaga kesatuan bangsa.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 41,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d6277302251a44cb2fe69d5046e9e389801b104f0e7356d7bd9c78f06cccef3d",
      "text": "Penari berpakaian merah dan kuning.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 35,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d8ec2659719fa8d569175cbd7e3b7bd9d196d9edd9ab4c1ead5b835621b309c5",
      "text": "kedamaian",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 9,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "d953e0e656a7cb48d414b6f605fbcdad5f65be5f3bb1aa7fb450f7aa81080146",
      "text": "emansipasi",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "dae0006decf8ad81c344aee72be7f6a286cc808d7a6851418fbee629c063ef52",
      "text": "Nggak apa-apa. Semua peserta juga jatuh, ha-ha!",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "dafccd71f7ccc99c0ff702f2d3174e2f9e889c705d0657c78953ba14739c994a",
      "text": "Ada banyak ___: balap karung, panjat pinang, dan makan kerupuk.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 63,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "dd70369477f26480b8742d44077d0104589e574c05dfab926fca287ce104652c",
      "text": "Pada Hari Kartini, para siswi memakai kebaya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 45,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e07adc73b7589d8c1a23353cd79662b314fea85dd125f36d96350dc799e9e1f9",
      "text": "Kartini menulis banyak surat kepada sahabatnya.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 47,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e7bdb9c9090192dd3447ee64a81446a598073a2e7114263a2d53c1a60bd6d9f2",
      "text": "imam",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 4,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "e98fee71a498c96c15aaeb94f7f8ed7b6e8a9f7354910cbbf77b9af7ca4e710e",
      "text": "Aku harus ngapain pas bendera naik?",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 35,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ea02ff0c6d64d3887a68df27c4d4ac505684afe05a241b63ebdb869c16984d35",
      "text": "Diadakan di mana?",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 17,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "eadbb63d2367c38379be2c9e286bdabf03af813f1ca475b5c2e649ee8ec20e07",
      "text": "Lapangan upacara terletak di jantung Kota Palopo.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "eaefebefd1cf840caa0e5866815caa90896324b266d27f4138e8170e3e77ad9c",
      "text": "berpakaian",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "eb365d3205cf4d2f6c63b257bc4b0976c72d305c61690335e82c7ba3faa6b146",
      "text": "Semua siswa menghadiri upacara bendera.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 39,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ec73c86701ead405e5e99f40c598a30064642cd9821820ca9ddb285d33b9855f",
      "text": "Berdiri dengan tenang. Dengan begitu, kita menghormati jasa para pahlawan.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 74,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ee993c9181fbdb0279ee101c5570407ac3fa14827cf45eb44288bb5039ccb516",
      "text": "Anak-anak pramuka membawa bendera Merah Putih.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 46,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "ef19018d4a4b0a7421d78a79550f3afa9f307d314ff22702d4fa111fadd154a4",
      "text": "Bener. Bu Ratna juga tangan kanan kepala sekolah kami.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 54,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "efa42f7cf230f14b34151933fee526c191f776ff5e289f4d2a4b719a255b25bd",
      "text": "Warga menghadiri upacara bendera di jantung kota.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 49,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f79aa6df4897c93a4645fef9195fd281f37daed09e37ae25f838376c80eb2e9e",
      "text": "ditetapkan",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 10,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "f923151e76d5ba43392d6b492e660ae04d4dbf546dbf52491fc68d0e1e41ad55",
      "text": "bendera",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 7,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "faa5b12eea45ab339e18c0c92961a290df1a9c41e35fa0898ca535e0c339ee57",
      "text": "Bener. Upacaranya mulai jam tujuh, jangan terlambat, ya.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 56,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fc2140285a0048ab9c99387d67b023dcb37766a39fd6e74b554e5f09413a74cf",
      "text": "Sama kayak di sini! Hari besar itu jantung kehidupan masyarakat.",
      "voice": "id_ardi",
      "chars": 64,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    },
    {
      "key": "fdc3d66acca827c4cd7a42b687eb1efd09dcfd47dd4591fafb25a704ebadb8f4",
      "text": "Indonesia merdeka pada tahun 1945.",
      "voice": "id_gadis",
      "chars": 34,
      "mime": "audio/mpeg"
    }
  ],
